# Custom shadcn/ui bricks

Visual canon: [DFM 0.8.1 component](https://www.figma.com/design/qlwKiMPZblz96VSM2F3DlS/DFM-for-Cursor?node-id=4191-5772) (`4191:5772`). Specs: `.cursor/gui/components/`, `.cursor/gui/panels/`, `.cursor/gui/dialogs/`, `.cursor/gui/views/`. Do not implement `View / …` as a brick from this rule — compose panels listed in the View spec.

## Layers

| Figma prefix | Code / spec | shadcn |
|--------------|-------------|--------|
| Primitive | `components/ui/` | Use as shipped. Theme tokens, do not fork Radix. |
| `Atom /` | `components/<domain>/` | Own `cva` keys from Figma (`type`, `size`, `state`). |
| `Item /` | same, composed of atoms | Do not copy atom hex into the item. |
| `Panel /` `Dialog /` `Popover /` | panel / dialog / popover | Compose bricks. Empty = `Content / Placeholder /`. |
| `View /` | `.cursor/gui/views/` | Shell composition only. Not a `components/` file. |

## Figma fetch

- One `get_design_context` per **variant set** (the frame with `type=` / `state=` / `size=`), never the whole canvas `4191:5772`.
- Do not fetch each variant symbol separately.
- Do not take colors from a `View /` screenshot if an Atom/Item set exists.
- Layout of columns (which panel, 788 vs 1120) comes from the View spec, not from inventing a splitter.

## Do / don't

```tsx
// ❌ default Badge pill for File DFM Status
<Badge variant="destructive">M</Badge>

// ✅ atom spec: 20×20, own type map, CSS variables
<FileStatusBadge type="modified" />
```

- No API calls inside an atom/item. Panels pass ready props. Folder-grid thumbnails: [virtual-scroll-preview](./virtual-scroll-preview.mdc).
- No extra chrome (counters, tooltips) unless the brick spec shows it.
- Two Figma atoms (file badge vs object badge) → two components, not `if`.
- Placeholders and empty copy live on the panel spec, not as a new atom, unless named `Atom / Cards / No History …`.
- `Atom / Swapper` is a Figma slot only: never ship the teal fill; put the real child (card atom, swipe bitmaps).
- `Panel / Project view`: Uncommitted files sit in `Item / Card Directory`, not `Item / Card`. Commit list uses `Item / Card`.
- `Item / Card Directory` (`6004:10960`): border is **dashed on every state** (Default / Hover / Selected / Disable). Do not copy `border-solid` from `Item / Card`.
